      "content": "the \"reaching out\" thing doesn't really work when there's no one left to reach out to. they all moved on so fast. it's like i'm just a memory they'd rather forget. i try to act normal but it's exhausting. it's just... it's so much easier to just stop trying to exist in this space if i'm already functionally dead to everyone anyway.",
