      "content": "but it's not just about feeling bad. it's the permanence of it. people don't just \"move on\" and let you back in after this. the social space is just... gone. burned. there's no path back to being a real person in their eyes. so i just keep thinking about how much easier it would be if the outside world finally matched how i feel on the inside. if i could just make the nothingness official.",
